{
  "lineCounts": {
    "Ann": 6,
    "Marionette": 11,
    "Mary-Ann": 16
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7425301",
      "subQuestName": "Go to the hidden dwelling to start the tea party",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "742530101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "742530101": {
            "id": "742530101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "To be honest, I'm still in shock.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742530102"
            ]
          },
          "742530102": {
            "id": "742530102",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "You know, back then, both Alain and I thought you'd already left this world.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742530103"
            ]
          },
          "742530103": {
            "id": "742530103",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Mary-Ann",
            "text": "Hmm... If we had woken up earlier, maybe we could have visited you and Alain. But, I suppose that's fate.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742530104"
            ]
          },
          "742530104": {
            "id": "742530104",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Ann",
            "text": "Ms. Mary-Ann...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742530105"
            ]
          },
          "742530105": {
            "id": "742530105",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Mary-Ann",
            "text": "Fate works in mysterious ways. Who would have thought that Ann and I would see a film poster featuring your portrait during our travels?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742530106"
            ]
          },
          "742530106": {
            "id": "742530106",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "So that's what made you think to contact me?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742530107"
            ]
          },
          "742530107": {
            "id": "742530107",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Ann",
            "text": "Precisely!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742530108"
            ]
          },
          "742530108": {
            "id": "742530108",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Mary-Ann",
            "text": "Ah... The aroma of coffee. It really takes me back... Hehe, thank you for inviting us to your tea party, Miss Sandrone.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742530109"
            ]
          },
          "742530109": {
            "id": "742530109",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Mary-Ann",
            "text": "Your garden is so elegantly arranged. It's perfect for a lady of such grace.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742530110"
            ]
          },
          "742530110": {
            "id": "742530110",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "This is the home Alain and I once shared. I feel it's only right that I maintain its beauty.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742530111"
            ]
          },
          "742530111": {
            "id": "742530111",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Mary-Ann",
            "text": "See? You're already so much better at this than my brother.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742530112"
            ]
          },
          "742530112": {
            "id": "742530112",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Ann",
            "text": "Alain never even decorated his room. He couldn't deal with pretty things.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742530113"
            ]
          },
          "742530113": {
            "id": "742530113",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Mary-Ann",
            "text": "That's right, and Rene was no different. Jakob and I were the only ones who could properly spruce up a room — and prepare a tea party.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742530114"
            ]
          },
          "742530114": {
            "id": "742530114",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "So he was like that even when he was little? I always thought it was due to his age...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742530115"
            ]
          },
          "742530115": {
            "id": "742530115",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Mary-Ann",
            "text": "He was always that way. He may have been book smart, but he was a bit of a klutz in other ways.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742530116"
            ]
          },
          "742530116": {
            "id": "742530116",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Mary-Ann",
            "text": "Maybe that's why he was the only one of us who chose painful reality over the illusion of a sweet dream.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742530117"
            ]
          },
          "742530117": {
            "id": "742530117",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Huh. I don't think he regretted that choice.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742530118"
            ]
          },
          "742530118": {
            "id": "742530118",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Ann",
            "text": "No, because that was his wish as a hero.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742530119"
            ]
          },
          "742530119": {
            "id": "742530119",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Ann",
            "text": "The regret is ours. His wish should never have stood alone.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742530120"
            ]
          },
          "742530120": {
            "id": "742530120",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Mary-Ann",
            "text": "What about you, Miss Sandrone? Is there something you wish for?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742530121"
            ]
          },
          "742530121": {
            "id": "742530121",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Alain once asked me that exact same question.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742530122"
            ]
          },
          "742530122": {
            "id": "742530122",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Mary-Ann",
            "text": "Hmm? So he asked you that, too?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742530123"
            ]
          },
          "742530123": {
            "id": "742530123",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Mary-Ann",
            "text": "My brother must have matured a lot. He never would have asked something like that when I knew him.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742530124"
            ]
          },
          "742530124": {
            "id": "742530124",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "\"Wish\" is such a hollow word. Can you ever have whatever you want? Hah, if that were the case, there would be no bad in the world.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742530125"
            ]
          },
          "742530125": {
            "id": "742530125",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "I'm doing what I want to do, what I believe to be right. I don't know if this counts as a wish, but it makes me happy.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742530126"
            ]
          },
          "742530126": {
            "id": "742530126",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Mary-Ann",
            "text": "Hmm, now that is a wonderful thing. I envy you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742530127"
            ]
          },
          "742530127": {
            "id": "742530127",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Mary-Ann",
            "text": "Then do you... resent Alain? Because he created you... in Mary-Ann's image.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742530128"
            ]
          },
          "742530128": {
            "id": "742530128",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Never. He always made it clear that I'm my own person — unique and distinct — and that I should choose my own life. So that's exactly what I did.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742530129"
            ]
          },
          "742530129": {
            "id": "742530129",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Ann",
            "text": "Haha, whether it's stories or food, as long as you're happy with your choices, then they're the right choices for you, Sandrone.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742530130"
            ]
          },
          "742530130": {
            "id": "742530130",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Mary-Ann",
            "text": "Exactly. So now, let's just quietly enjoy the food you've so carefully prepared for us."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7425302",
      "subQuestName": "Go to the hidden dwelling to start the tea party",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
